# Large media excluded from history -- stays live/deployed on disk, just not
# tracked in git. Git doesn't dedup binary diffs (every version adds full
# weight to history forever) and GitHub hard-caps individual files at 100MB
# regardless, so the big ones here couldn't be pushed even if tracked.

# Bulk video content. Two small ad clips are explicitly kept -- everything
# else (garfield-effect-*.mp4 at 3GB/790MB, the esl-preview episode previews
# at 30-60MB each) is excluded by the blanket rule below.
*.mp4
!/assets/videos/brandsmith-ad.mp4
!/assets/videos/history-kit-ad.mp4

# Large print-deliverable PDFs. The smaller cover/interior PDFs elsewhere in
# lulu/ are fine to track -- these two are the multi-MB outliers.
/lulu/bag-on-maple-street-interior.pdf
/lulu/bag-on-maple-street-interior-v2.pdf

# Editor / tooling backups -- never track these
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.OLD*
*.orig
